1
00:00:00,310 --> 00:00:03,260
The story of the man who recited al-Fatihah for three days.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,230
The uncle of Kharijah ibn al-Salt passed by some people who had a sick man bound in iron.

3
00:00:08,670 --> 00:00:09,230
One of them said to him:

4
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:11,020
“Do you have anything to treat him with?”

5
00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:13,150
So he recited Surat al-Fatihah over him

6
00:00:13,280 --> 00:00:14,070
for three days,

7
00:00:14,310 --> 00:00:15,390
morning and evening,

8
00:00:15,740 --> 00:00:17,550
gathering his saliva and spitting lightly.

9
00:00:18,010 --> 00:00:19,650
It was as if the man was released from a bond,

10
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:21,730
and the people gave him a payment of sheep.

11
00:00:22,270 --> 00:00:24,510
He came to the Prophet (peace be upon him) and told him,

12
00:00:24,910 --> 00:00:26,850
and the Prophet (peace be upon him) said to him:

13
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:27,400
“Eat.

14
00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:29,750
By my life, whoever eats by a false ruqyah —

15
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,490
you have eaten by a true ruqyah.”

16
00:00:31,980 --> 00:00:32,380
Reflect:

17
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:35,900
the Surat al-Fatihah you recite every day in your prayer

18
00:00:36,190 --> 00:00:39,690
is the very ruqyah the Prophet (peace be upon him) approved.

19
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:43,000
Share this story with someone you love, and follow the channel.

